  "alt_title": "I Became a Genius at the Academy in a World Where Magic Reigns Supreme, I Became an Academy Genius in a Magic-Supreme World, ในโลกที่เวทมนตร์คือทุกสิ่ง ฉันเกิดใหม่เป็นอัจฉริยะแห่งอะคาเดมี, 魔法至上の世界でアカデミーの天才になっていた | I Became an Academy Genius in a Magic-Supreme World | 魔法至上の世界でアカデミーの天才になっていた | Supreme Academy Genius | I Became a Genius at the Academy in a World Where Magic Reigns Supreme | In a World Where Magic Reigns Supreme, He Became an Academy Genius",
